WEBVTT

00:00:00.333 --> 00:00:02.133
Meet Ino Loyalty.

00:00:02.867 --> 00:00:06.733
Decide how points are earned, spent, and when they expire.

00:00:07.467 --> 00:00:10.800
Give your best customers tiers with perks of their own.

00:00:12.067 --> 00:00:14.067
Build a campaign in five steps,

00:00:14.067 --> 00:00:17.467
and test it on a sample basket before anyone sees it.

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:27.400
Or just describe it.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:32.100
Ino AI turns one sentence into a campaign draft you can check.

00:00:32.833 --> 00:00:37.433
Say who you want to reach, and see how many members match before you save.

00:00:38.167 --> 00:00:41.933
Ino AI also finds campaigns worth running in your own data,

00:00:41.933 --> 00:00:44.467
each with a budget and a hold-out group.

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:50.033
Before anything goes live, your approver sees the cost and every overlap.

00:00:51.733 --> 00:00:54.600
Once it's running, ask for a second opinion.

00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:58.267
Changes go through a draft, so the campaign never stops.

00:01:00.867 --> 00:01:04.867
Every member in one view, with a wallet card in your brand.

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:10.533
Developers get a plan built on the real API,

00:01:10.533 --> 00:01:13.533
and failed calls explained in plain words.

00:01:14.267 --> 00:01:15.767
Privacy is built in.

00:01:15.767 --> 00:01:20.067
Erasure requests are reviewed, then completed end to end.

00:01:20.800 --> 00:01:23.167
Ino Loyalty, by Tryino.
